Package: SpikeTrainPatternDetector
Type: Package
Title: Spike Train Pattern Detector
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: person(given = "Houchun", family = "Zhou", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "zhouhouchun@outlook.com", comment = c("Display name" = "Zhou Houchun"))
Author: Zhou Houchun [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Zhou Houchun <zhouhouchun@outlook.com>
Description: Productized Shiny-based spike train pattern detector and semi-supervised review platform. The package provides quality control, rule-based candidate detection, eventness audit, Mean-ISI, Pasquale logISIH/newBD, pCLAMP-style Poisson Surprise, and Robust Gaussian Surprise support layers, train-wise threshold suggestions, and reproducible export reports without treating support-layer results as final ground truth.
